# Local development secrets for `wrangler dev`.
#
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (which is gitignored) and fill in real values.
# Never commit `.dev.vars`. Production secrets are set with `wrangler secret put`
# by the deploy workflow, not from this file.
#
# Generate a strong JWT secret, e.g.:  openssl rand -hex 32

ONYX_JWT_SECRET=""
# Supabase project keys for the All-Father exchange path. The publishable key is
# safe to expose to browsers; the secret key must stay server-side only.
SUPABASE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=""
SUPABASE_SECRET_KEY=""
# Optional: only needed to exercise file downloads (signed Hugging Face S3 GETs).
HF_S3_ACCESS_KEY_ID=""
HF_S3_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=""
